abstract: >-
  Mathematical accounts, Lean 4 proofs and reproducible verification tools for
  covering designs. Includes C(13,7,4)=30, C(20,11,3)=12, and lower bounds and
  exact values for C(2k-c,k,3), together with supporting formalisations of
  established results. OpenAI language models substantially assisted its
  development, formalisation, checking and writing. The proof accounts and
  third-party notices document mathematical attribution and historical
  constructions.
keywords:
  - covering designs
  - covering numbers
  - combinatorics
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
